OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe day will begin with
OL,6,Fscattered showers interspersed with
OL,7,Fbright spells. The showers will ease
OL,8,Fthrough the mooring leaving the
OL,9,Fafternoon mostly dry with increasing
OL,10,Fsunny spells. The strong westerly wind
OL,11,Fwill begin to ease down from the
OL,12,Fafternoon.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FClear spells with the chance
OL,15,Fof an odd shower. The fresh westerly
OL,16,Fwind will fall light and changeable
OL,17,Ftowards the morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
