OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FAfter a dry start rain will
OL,6,Fspread northeast during the morning.
OL,7,FThis will clear from the south from
OL,8,Fthe late afternoon. The wind will
OL,9,Ffreshen during the morning.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FA
OL,12,Fband of cloud and rain will pass
OL,13,Fsoutheast Tuesday with showers
OL,14,Ffollowing Wednesday. Drier Thursday
OL,15,Funtil rain moves in from the west in
OL,16,Fthe afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
